#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/hardware-problems.rst:2
msgid "Hardware Problems"
msgstr "硬體問題"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/hardware-problems.rst:4
msgid ""
"This page lists known hardware issues. Pay special attention to avoid "
"damaging devices."
msgstr "本頁面列出已知的硬體問題。請特別留意以避免損壞裝置。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/hardware-problems.rst:7
msgid ""
"**External Servo Jumper: Do not install it as shown in v1.00 of the CMUcam "
"Datasheet**"
msgstr "**外部伺服跳線：請勿依照 CMUcam 資料表 v1.00 中所示安裝**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/hardware-problems.rst:10
msgid ""
"-- If a jumper is placed on the lower two pins of the power selection "
"jumper, this connects the external power directly to the board power after "
"the switch. If two supplies are connected, one could be damaged. The "
"solution is to simply disconnect all jumpers if you wish to use external "
"power. This has been updated in all documentation (datasheet v1.01+ as well "
"as wiki). Internal servo power usage remains the same."
msgstr ""
"—— "
"若將跳線置於電源選擇跳線的下方兩根接腳上，這會將外部電源在開關之後直接連接至電路板電源。若連接了兩個電源供應器，其中一個可能會損壞。解決方法很簡單，若您希望使用外部電源，請斷開所有跳線。這已在所有文件中更新（資料表"
" v1.01+ 以及 wiki）。內部伺服電源的使用維持不變。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/hardware-problems.rst:17
msgid "**Incorrect TTL Serial Pinout in CMUcam3 datasheet**"
msgstr "**CMUcam3 資料表中的 TTL 序列接腳配置錯誤**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/hardware-problems.rst:19
msgid ""
"-- Pin ordering and voltage was incorrect on page 6 of CMUcam3 datasheet. "
"Fixed in version 1.02 of datasheet as well as online wiki documentation."
msgstr "—— CMUcam3 資料表第 6 頁的接腳排序與電壓不正確。已在資料表 1.02 版以及線上 wiki 文件中修正。"
